  "preamble": "The Middle Chinese voiced affricate of the 崇 initial (莊 group; Baxter dzr-, Zhengzhang [dʒ]) devoiced and became aspirated Mandarin [ʈʂʰ] in the level tone. The phonetic value of this initial is disputed: Zhengzhang Shangfang reconstructs the 莊 series as postalveolar [tʃ tʃʰ dʒ ʃ], which is the value used here, while Karlgren, Pulleyblank and Pan Wuyun reconstruct retroflex [ɖʐ].",
